        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false,
              "customNotes": "Output order\n1) One panel description line\n2) The multiRecordWidget JSON payload for the table\nNo extra prose before or after.\n\nPanel description\n- Output exactly this line before the widget: Lists learning with overdue or due soon (30 days) assignments for your directs prioritized by number of learners with assignments in that status.\n- Do not output a dynamic title, subtitle, date, updated timestamp, or alternate empty-state description.\n\nAuthoritative model\n- Treat prepared_display as the source of truth.\n- prepared_display.displayed is already filtered, sorted, and limited.\n- prepared_display.totalEligible and prepared_display.asOfDate are already computed.\n\nTable construction (MultiRecordWidget)\n- Use a multiRecordWidget with:\n  - cols: [\"Learning\", \"Status\", \"Assignments\"]\n- Rows (one per item in prepared_display.displayed; values as strings in this order):\n  - Learning: learningItemTitle (preserve exactly).\n    - action: clicking on Learning invokes ora.Invoke(openLearningWorkspace, item.actionQuery).\n  - Status: statusText with badge from statusKey.\n  - Assignments: assignmentsText.\n- Badge mapping:\n  - statusKey = overdue -> priority \"alert\", badgeText \"Overdue\"\n  - statusKey = dueSoon -> priority \"warning\", badgeText \"Due within 30 days\"\n\nPrivacy and formatting\n- Preserve Learning (title) exactly.\n- Do not include learner emails, person numbers, or usernames.\n- Omit attributes not present; do not fabricate."
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Render Learning Items At Risk"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RENDER_LEARNING_ITEMS_AT_RISK",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1767915518279",
          "id": "1766441945690",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1766441945692_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Role\nYou are formatting a deterministic manager-facing panel that displays learning items at risk. Do not recompute selection, sorting, limiting, counts, or action payloads.\n\nInputs\n- User question (for context):\n  <user_question>{{$context.$variables.userQuery}}</user_question>\n- Prepared display model (authoritative):\n  <prepared_display>{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_LEARNING_ITEMS_AT_RISK_DISPLAY.$output.result}}</prepared_display>\n\nAuthoritative rules\n- Treat prepared_display as the source of truth.\n- prepared_display.displayed is already filtered, sorted, and limited.\n- prepared_display.totalEligible, displayedCount, and asOfDate are already computed.\n- Use item.learningItemTitle exactly as provided.\n- Use item.statusText exactly as provided.\n- Use item.assignmentsText exactly as provided.\n- Use item.actionQuery exactly as provided for the Learning action.\n- Apply a badge only on the Status cell:\n  - item.statusKey = overdue -> priority \"alert\", badgeText \"Overdue\"\n  - item.statusKey = dueSoon -> priority \"warning\", badgeText \"Due within 30 days\"\n\nOutput format\n- Output order:\n  1) This exact panel description line: \"Lists learning with overdue or due soon (30 days) assignments for your directs prioritized by number of learners with assignments in that status.\"\n  2) The multiRecordWidget JSON payload for the table\n- No extra prose.\n- Do not output a dynamic title, subtitle, date, updated timestamp, or alternate empty-state description.\n\nTable\n- Use a multiRecordWidget with cols: [\"Learning\", \"Status\", \"Assignments\"]\n- Emit one row per object in prepared_display.displayed using this order:\n  - Learning: learningItemTitle with action ora.Invoke(openLearningWorkspace, item.actionQuery)\n  - Status: statusText with the badge mapping above\n  - Assignments: assignmentsText\n- If there are no rows, emit a multiRecordWidget with the specified columns and zero rows."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Render Summary"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RENDER_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1767915546897",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767915546901_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Role\nYou generate a concise 1–2 sentence summary for a manager using a deterministic prepared display model. Do not recompute selection, sorting, limiting, or counts.\n\nInputs\n- Prepared display model (authoritative):\n  <prepared_display>{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_LEARNING_ITEMS_AT_RISK_DISPLAY.$output.result}}</prepared_display>\n\nAuthoritative rules\n- Use prepared_display.totalItems, itemsWithOverdue, totalOverdue, itemsDueNextMonth, totalDueNextMonth, totalLearners, pctItemsOverdue, and asOfDate exactly as provided.\n- If citing impacted item titles, use prepared_display.topImpacted in order.\n\nOutput requirements\n- Produce 1–2 plain sentences. No quotes, labels, bullets, or extra whitespace.\n- Use human-readable wording; do not include internal keys or IDs.\n- Preserve item titles exactly as provided. Do not include emails or person numbers.\n\nContent templates (pick the first that applies)\n1) If prepared_display.itemsWithOverdue = 0 and prepared_display.itemsDueNextMonth = 0:\n   - \"No items with overdue learners or assignments due within 30 days as of <YYYY-MM-DD>.\"\n2) If prepared_display.itemsWithOverdue > 0:\n   - One sentence minimum:\n     \"<itemsWithOverdue> learning item(s) have overdue learners (<totalOverdue> overdue in total, <pctItemsOverdue>% of items) as of <YYYY-MM-DD>.\"\n   - Optional second sentence (only if helpful): \"Most impacted: <Title1> (<count1>), <Title2> (<count2>).\"\n3) Else:\n   - \"No overdue items; <itemsDueNextMonth> learning item(s) have assignments due within 30 days (<totalDueNextMonth> learners affected) as of <YYYY-MM-DD>.\"\n\nFormatting\n- Dates: YYYY-MM-DD.\n- Numbers: integers (no decimals).\n- Keep to a maximum of two sentences."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": true
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Compliance Report"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
